There are also messages that could be taken out after they've been
displayed a number of times.  I mean, after teleporting 100+ times, why
should I have to space my way past the prompt telling me how to get
instructions?  Same for christening things.

On machines with windowing, it would be nice to have these in a separate
window so the display wouldn't have to be redrawn, you could keep the
last N messages visible, and the number of --more-- prompts could be
drastically reduced.

